{"name":"Deep Space Sparkle","hex":"#4a646c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"deep","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Extending, reaching or positioned far from a point of reference, especially downwards.\nExtending far down from the top, or surface, to the bottom, literally or figuratively.","Extending far down from the top, or surface, to the bottom, literally or figuratively."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Far, especially far down through something or into something, physically or figuratively.","In a profound, not superficial, manner."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/deep"},{"term":"space","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Unlimited or generalized extent, physical or otherwise.\nThe distance between objects. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The distance between objects. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To roam, walk, wander.","To set some distance apart."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/space"},{"term":"sparkle","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A little spark; a scintillation.","Brilliance; luster."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To emit sparks; to throw off ignited or incandescent particles.","To shine as if throwing off sparks; to emit flashes of light; to scintillate; to twinkle."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sparkle"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sparkle (Honkai: Star Rail)","blocks":[{"text":"Sparkle is a character in the video game Honkai: Star Rail, published by miHoYo. In the game, she is a member of the Masked Fools, an intergalactic organization devoted to elation and fun. She was released in version 2.0 of the game in February 2024, and received favorable reviews for her cute appearance and intrigue."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/fa/Sparkle_in_Honkai_Star_Rail.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sparkle_(Honkai%3A_Star_Rail)","wikidata":"Q136526546"},{"title":"Space","blocks":[{"text":"Space is a three-dimensional continuum containing positions and directions. In classical physics, physical space is often conceived in three linear dimensions. Modern physicists usually consider it, with time, to be part of a boundless four-dimensional continuum known as spacetime. The concept of space is considered to be of fundamental importance to an understanding of the physical universe. However, disagreement continues between philosophers over whether it is itself an entity, a relationship between entities, or part of a conceptual framework."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/3D_coordinate_system.svg/330px-3D_coordinate_system.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Space","wikidata":"Q107"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/e4/Sparxie_in_Honkai_Star_Rail.png/250px-Sparxie_in_Honkai_Star_Rail.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e4/Sparxie_in_Honkai_Star_Rail.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/e4/Sparxie_in_Honkai_Star_Rail.png/250px-Sparxie_in_Honkai_Star_Rail.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Official portrait of Sparxie","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASparxie_in_Honkai_Star_Rail.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Honkai_Star_Rail_Fes_in_Shanghai2024.jpg/500px-Honkai_Star_Rail_Fes_in_Shanghai2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Honkai_Star_Rail_Fes_in_Shanghai2024.jpg/1280px-Honkai_Star_Rail_Fes_in_Shan